WEBVTT

00:14.774 --> 00:17.944
Meeting someone is surely

00:17.944 --> 00:21.114
The dawn within our hearts

00:21.114 --> 00:27.454
And a new breeze is born from there

00:27.454 --> 00:33.894
Once you've realized you're not alone

00:33.894 --> 00:40.404
The translucent Moon will smile

00:40.404 --> 00:46.774
Then, the prelude you can hear in your spirit

00:46.774 --> 00:52.944
Is a nostalgic but unusual song

00:52.944 --> 00:56.154
We are not alone

00:56.154 --> 00:59.324
Surely

00:59.324 --> 01:07.494
Everyone is born so that they can meet someone

01:07.494 --> 01:15.174
Ah, out into the boundless world...

01:15.174 --> 01:23.474
Yes, so we may search for love

01:42.634 --> 01:44.034
All set, Feena.

01:44.034 --> 01:45.304
Thank you.

01:45.304 --> 01:47.164
Ah! Feena, the pot!

01:49.374 --> 01:50.044
Are you okay?

01:50.044 --> 01:50.304
Perhaps I should help them after all...
Are you okay?

01:50.304 --> 01:52.304
Perhaps I should help them after all...

01:52.304 --> 01:55.474
No, Mia! Just stay right here.

01:56.044 --> 01:57.534
What are you two doing?

01:58.384 --> 02:01.644
I swear. I thought everyone was
taking their time this morning.

02:01.914 --> 02:03.254
Um...

02:03.254 --> 02:04.814
Well...

02:05.254 --> 02:08.524
The two of them held back because
they didn't want to get in the way.

02:11.494 --> 02:14.994
My apologies! Pay us no mind
and please continue!

02:14.994 --> 02:16.294
"Continue"?

02:23.704 --> 02:25.804
Are you all right, Feena?

02:25.804 --> 02:28.144
Thank you, Tatsuya.

02:28.644 --> 02:29.634
Feena...

02:30.144 --> 02:31.374
Tatsuya...

02:37.584 --> 02:39.314
Quit thinking weird things!

02:40.224 --> 02:42.024
Tatsuya?

02:42.024 --> 02:43.424
Miss Feena?

02:43.424 --> 02:45.694
Please try to restrain yourselves
inside the house, okay?

02:49.964 --> 02:51.434
- Episode 9-
The Shadow that
Approaches the Princess

02:51.434 --> 02:53.804
- Episode 9-
The Shadow that
Approaches the Princess
The Shadow that
Approaches the Princess

02:53.804 --> 02:55.934
- Episode 9-
The Shadow that
Approaches the Princess

02:56.674 --> 02:59.044
But it's a good thing, huh?

02:59.044 --> 03:00.634
What's with you all of a sudden?

03:01.674 --> 03:06.344
It's just, you look so happy.
My big brother and Miss Feena.

03:06.344 --> 03:08.784
Yes, I think so too!

03:11.854 --> 03:15.424
It's hard to wait for Karen to come back, isn't it?

03:15.424 --> 03:19.694
Then you'll have to go back to the Moon
so you can introduce yourself.

03:19.694 --> 03:24.964
Huh? So you're going to do that thing?
"Father, please give me your daughter's hand!"

03:25.334 --> 03:30.244
This isn't some old soap opera, you know.
Um, but what DO you actually do?

03:30.244 --> 03:33.374
"Please give..."?
It makes me sound like an object.

03:33.374 --> 03:38.974
O-of course you're not!
To me, you're the most important...

03:48.654 --> 03:52.154
I'm just glad to see it looks
you're doing well, Feena!

03:53.294 --> 03:56.894
Also, you're looking kind of pretty
these days, huh?

03:57.804 --> 04:02.074
I mean, you're a princess
and you were already super pretty,

04:02.074 --> 04:04.804
but lately it's like you're even prettier!

04:04.974 --> 04:06.704
Well yeah!

04:06.704 --> 04:09.244
That's because Feena's engaged!

04:09.244 --> 04:10.334
Natsuki!

04:10.714 --> 04:12.344
You have to keep that a secret.

04:12.344 --> 04:16.214
What? What?! You mean ENGAGED engaged?

04:16.214 --> 04:17.924
Well, actually...

04:17.924 --> 04:22.054
Getting engaged at our age...
That's a princess for ya!

04:22.054 --> 04:28.794
I bet he's some prince from somewhere!
He couldn't possibly be a commoner, right?

04:29.164 --> 04:31.804
No way, no way!

04:31.804 --> 04:36.804
Especially none of the guys in our class,
they're practically worthless!

04:36.804 --> 04:40.604
There are plenty of Earth men
who are absolutely wonderful!

04:41.014 --> 04:42.404
In particular, Tats-

04:43.044 --> 04:45.814
That would be an even WORSE
thing to say, right?!

04:45.814 --> 04:46.804
Huh?

04:53.854 --> 04:55.284
Tatsuya!

04:57.324 --> 04:58.224
Jin!

04:58.224 --> 05:02.164
Heading out with such a happy face...
It must be a date, hmm?

05:02.394 --> 05:03.194
Yes!

05:04.704 --> 05:10.074
As your elder, I was hoping to see you looking
a bit more embarrassed...

05:10.074 --> 05:13.944
That's how everyone around here has been.
I've gotten used to it.

05:14.144 --> 05:16.004
Well, I don't want to be late.

05:16.644 --> 05:19.874
You're starting to look sort of
promising, Tatsuya.

05:20.014 --> 05:22.284
You could learn a thing or two.

05:22.514 --> 05:25.654
After all, you've been docked three years' pay.

05:25.654 --> 05:28.124
Father!

05:36.594 --> 05:38.634
Good, good!

05:38.634 --> 05:42.734
The profile of a young princess
on her first date... So lovely!

05:43.804 --> 05:46.244
From start to finish, this'll be perfectly-

05:46.704 --> 05:49.144
Staff! What're you doin'?!

05:49.144 --> 05:50.944
Let's not do this, just for today.

05:50.944 --> 05:53.614
What are you talkin' about?
This is a special occasion that-

05:53.614 --> 05:55.604
It's special, which is why we shouldn't!

05:55.954 --> 06:00.114
Staff! You're a failure as my staff! Let go!

06:00.824 --> 06:02.414
However, this is the right thing to do.

06:03.454 --> 06:06.564
Tonight we drink to the future of
the Princess and the rest of 'em.

06:06.564 --> 06:09.494
Staff! Get us out of here in three seconds!

06:09.494 --> 06:10.724
Yes, Boss!

06:15.704 --> 06:24.544
Tsunaida kono te wo hanasazu ni ite
Stay here and don't let go of this hand you've clasped

06:24.544 --> 06:33.284
Shiawasaesugiru to kowaku naru kara
Because if I'm too happy I'll get frightened

06:33.284 --> 06:42.164
Yuuhi yo, kono mama sora wo kazatte
O setting Sun, stay as you are and adorn the sky

06:42.164 --> 06:50.904
Issho no jikan ga owaranu you ni
So that our time together will not end

06:50.904 --> 06:59.644
Konna ni ai seru hito
There is only one person in this world

06:59.644 --> 07:08.484
Sekai de tatta hitori
I can love this much

07:18.664 --> 07:23.534
Sorry! I thought I'd try startling you.

07:24.704 --> 07:28.244
I'm really sorry! Trying something like that
after I'd kept you waiting...

07:28.244 --> 07:30.374
No, that's not it.

07:31.284 --> 07:35.044
This is how much it hurts since
I've started loving you.

07:36.614 --> 07:41.754
Time feels so very long when you're not here.

07:42.994 --> 07:44.664
I've missed you, too.

07:44.664 --> 07:45.784
Tatsuya...

07:46.394 --> 07:47.524
Feena...

08:03.444 --> 08:07.784
I've read your report. Karen,
have you lost your wits?!

08:07.954 --> 08:08.914
No, Sire.

08:09.484 --> 08:11.574
He is an uneducated commoner!

08:12.084 --> 08:15.354
His social standing is indeed a problem...

08:15.354 --> 08:18.624
But as a person, he is a most
favorable young man.

08:20.734 --> 08:23.904
Like Madam Feena, he is forthright and loyal.

08:23.904 --> 08:26.864
And he is driven, never giving up.

08:27.234 --> 08:31.364
I'm sure he would be, to get along with Feena.

08:31.604 --> 08:35.744
However, neither the noble families
nor the Moon's people

08:35.744 --> 08:37.784
would accept a marriage to an
Earthling, would they?

08:37.784 --> 08:41.714
What's more, Feena already
has a fiancé, Jurgen.

08:43.354 --> 08:45.714
I am aware of the insolence of what
I am about to say...

08:46.424 --> 08:52.624
I do not believe Lord Jurgen von Kruger
is a suitable partner for the Princess.

08:52.624 --> 08:53.694
What?!

08:53.694 --> 08:56.564
Well, well. Karen Clavius.

08:59.934 --> 09:02.374
I am currently granting an audience, Jurgen!

09:02.604 --> 09:04.904
My apologies, Your Excellency.

09:05.644 --> 09:11.544
But upon hearing of Madam Karen's return,
I was unable to restrain my excitement.

09:12.084 --> 09:15.684
How does Miss Feena fare upon the Earth?

09:15.684 --> 09:17.284
Her condition is unchanged.

09:17.284 --> 09:19.484
Is that so? Incidentally...

09:19.484 --> 09:23.014
does the princess still reside
in that Earthling's house?

09:27.334 --> 09:31.394
Your Excellency, with your permission
I will now take my leave.

09:32.164 --> 09:35.134
However, I have no intention of backing down.

09:35.704 --> 09:38.404
Leave now and compose yourself!

09:48.914 --> 09:50.584
You heard that, did you?

09:50.584 --> 09:53.314
Such was not my intent, but...

09:53.854 --> 09:57.884
My apologies. But please do not
reproach Madam Karen.

09:58.294 --> 10:01.284
All this is due to my own inexperience.

10:01.994 --> 10:06.904
However, I believe I am well suited
to become Miss Feena's betrothed,

10:06.904 --> 10:09.564
and intend to continue as planned.

10:10.004 --> 10:13.804
Jurgen, I would have you
remember those words.

10:14.644 --> 10:15.944
Still,

10:15.944 --> 10:20.384
why would Karen, who has served me faithfully
these long years, do something so reckless?

10:25.554 --> 10:30.084
Jurgen von Kruger...
This will not be an easy task.

10:30.564 --> 10:35.934
But for Feena's sake, and thus for
the kingdom and its people...

10:37.404 --> 10:40.804
Karen Clavius, military attaché to Earth.

10:40.804 --> 10:44.734
We are taking you into custody
on suspicion of treason.

10:49.644 --> 10:54.044
Jurgen! I never thought he would resort
to such forceful measures!

11:11.134 --> 11:12.124
It's beautiful, isn't it?

11:12.564 --> 11:18.634
I wonder why it is... this shade of red
moves me more than any other.

11:19.804 --> 11:22.744
I guess it's because even though
it's red all year round...

11:22.744 --> 11:26.944
Or rather, because this is the season
when it ends, that it looks pretty.

11:28.384 --> 11:32.824
To think, they're beautiful because
they fall, scattering... It's sad.

11:32.824 --> 11:35.554
But after fall, winter comes.

11:36.224 --> 11:37.354
Winter...

11:57.544 --> 12:01.084
Back then, we sat there like this, didn't we?

12:01.084 --> 12:02.074
Yes.

12:08.424 --> 12:09.324
The pendant...

12:10.224 --> 12:13.424
I just now noticed, but that pendant you put on
when you wear your dress...

12:13.424 --> 12:15.594
you've had it since we first met.

12:16.164 --> 12:18.564
It's a memento of my mother.

12:19.334 --> 12:28.074
It contains her last message to me...
But I still don't know what it says.

12:28.674 --> 12:30.014
Why not?

12:30.014 --> 12:34.014
"Listen to it only when you've found
the person you truly want to marry."

12:34.014 --> 12:35.504
That's what she told me.

12:35.984 --> 12:37.784
So...

12:37.784 --> 12:40.254
I wonder if now is that time.

12:45.864 --> 12:46.984
Feena...
Tatsuya...

12:59.874 --> 13:00.934
You...

13:04.084 --> 13:09.344
Wreath! We were worried.
You left without saying anything.

13:09.714 --> 13:11.084
Tatsuya, wait.

13:18.624 --> 13:19.354
Tatsuya!

13:22.964 --> 13:24.194
Ow...

13:25.104 --> 13:27.194
Are you all right, Tatsuya?

13:27.434 --> 13:29.764
Wreath! Why did you?

13:35.814 --> 13:42.544
Tatsuya Asagiri. Feena Fam Earthlight.
I do not approve of your union.

13:42.914 --> 13:44.754
Wreath, what are you?

13:44.754 --> 13:48.244
I have observed you this whole time.

13:48.654 --> 13:52.964
"Observed"? You're saying
you've been watching us?

13:52.964 --> 13:54.254
Why would you do that?

13:54.464 --> 13:57.724
This is the end. Give up on Princess Feena.

13:59.634 --> 14:01.434
There's no way I could do that!

14:01.434 --> 14:04.774
I see. Then I shall dispose of you.

14:13.844 --> 14:14.954
Tatsuya!

14:14.954 --> 14:16.144
Do not move!

14:16.814 --> 14:19.844
I do not intend to harm you.

14:20.184 --> 14:24.024
Once I dispose of Tatsuya Asagiri,
I will have accomplished my goal.

14:24.264 --> 14:29.254
Do you think that by saying that
I'll just abandon him?

14:31.334 --> 14:32.534
Feena...

14:32.534 --> 14:34.004
Let's get out of here, Tatsuya.

14:34.404 --> 14:35.394
Ow...

14:45.784 --> 14:48.414
It can't be... Why is this happening?

14:48.414 --> 14:51.784
She could be an assassin sent from the Moon.

14:51.784 --> 14:54.384
No way! That little girl?

14:55.024 --> 14:58.724
There's no such thing as an assassin
that can be recognized at a glance.

14:58.724 --> 14:59.754
But...

15:02.194 --> 15:03.394
Tatsuya!

15:03.964 --> 15:05.294
Feena, no!

15:12.204 --> 15:13.644
Tatsuya!

15:13.644 --> 15:18.444
Forget about me and just get out of here.
I'm the one she's after, right?

15:18.444 --> 15:20.984
There's no way I could do that!

15:20.984 --> 15:23.584
Whatever happens, we'll face it together!

15:23.584 --> 15:24.514
Feena...

15:46.374 --> 15:49.644
Wreath! You can hear me, can't you? Wreath!

15:49.944 --> 15:56.254
Stop this! I can't believe you'd do
something like this! Why?!

15:56.254 --> 15:57.214
Wreath!

16:00.154 --> 16:02.354
I am not Wreathlit.

16:02.554 --> 16:04.684
Not... Wreath?

16:04.964 --> 16:07.494
My name is Fiacca.

16:07.494 --> 16:08.994
Fiacca?

16:08.994 --> 16:12.504
I exist by "borrowing" Wreath's body.

16:12.504 --> 16:15.094
Her body? What are you?!

16:15.804 --> 16:18.534
Once, war raged between
the Moon and the Earth.

16:27.854 --> 16:30.154
The conflict intensified,

16:30.154 --> 16:34.954
with massive casualties on both sides
and only eternal sorrow remaining.

16:35.924 --> 16:37.824
Or rather, it should have remained.

16:38.924 --> 16:45.354
Do you know of Mitsurugasaki, the
inlet that you Earthlings liken to a full moon?

16:45.504 --> 16:50.204
It is actually a crater caused by a lunar attack.

16:52.044 --> 16:57.174
But people forget. Sorrow, torment... Everything.

16:57.314 --> 16:59.784
And then they repeat the same mistakes.

16:59.914 --> 17:02.384
But I will not forget.

17:02.954 --> 17:09.054
I am a manifestation, born of the hearts
of those who suffered in the war!

17:09.354 --> 17:10.494
What?!

17:10.494 --> 17:12.824
Those who suffered in the war?

17:13.864 --> 17:17.854
Is that why you try to stop conflict
before it starts?

17:18.104 --> 17:20.964
Correct. That is my mission.

17:21.104 --> 17:26.094
However, a princess of the Moon and
an Earthling have reformed their bond...

17:30.444 --> 17:34.314
And I allow neither to grow close
to the other again!

17:34.684 --> 17:38.844
Stop it, Fiacca! We wouldn't start a war!

17:39.084 --> 17:44.084
The error will occur. I shall not allow
the same tragedy to happen again!

17:44.254 --> 17:45.494
No!

17:45.494 --> 17:49.134
Even so, you're just going to give up
believing in people?

17:49.134 --> 17:50.154
Feena!

17:51.204 --> 17:53.604
I have been betrayed many times over.

17:53.734 --> 17:56.504
If the Moon and the Earth
got to know each other,

17:56.504 --> 18:00.994
their people would lose the desire to hurt
one another. That's what I believe!

18:01.374 --> 18:02.844
That is idealism.

18:02.844 --> 18:07.044
It's having ideals that allows one
to believe in the future!

18:07.214 --> 18:11.314
Also, is eliminating Tatsuya
something you really want to do?

18:12.884 --> 18:14.514
Answer me, Wreath!

18:23.194 --> 18:25.684
Do not be confused, Wreathlit.

18:28.634 --> 18:32.434
When people grow close to one another,
it always results in conflict.

18:32.604 --> 18:38.564
That's true. But that can always be overcome!
Just like Tatsuya and me!

18:43.214 --> 18:45.554
That's right... She's right!

18:46.124 --> 18:47.554
You're the one who's wrong!

18:49.524 --> 18:53.624
If you truly want peace, you have to
go through life with people,

18:53.624 --> 18:57.494
encountering hardships but still believing
in them and moving forward!

18:58.004 --> 18:59.834
That's the only way you can do it!

19:22.654 --> 19:23.684
Tatsuya!

19:29.664 --> 19:30.634
Tatsuya!

19:31.234 --> 19:33.764
Wake up! Tatsuya!

19:33.764 --> 19:38.774
Stop, please!

19:38.774 --> 19:40.104
Tatsuya!

19:40.104 --> 19:43.104
Don't take the person I love away from me!

19:43.544 --> 19:46.484
I live to perform my mission.

19:46.784 --> 19:48.714
Resent me if you like. I do not care.

19:48.714 --> 19:49.874
Wait.

19:50.954 --> 19:52.554
Wreathlit?

19:52.554 --> 19:55.224
Just stop it, Miss Fiacca.

19:55.224 --> 19:59.714
Anything you say is of no use.
I shall dispose of Tatsuya Asagiri.

20:01.234 --> 20:04.424
Are you going to keep being sad forever?

20:05.504 --> 20:07.904
Sad? Me?

20:08.374 --> 20:12.324
Miss Feena said she wouldn't let
that terrible war happen...

20:12.474 --> 20:15.064
And that's because she has someone she loves.

20:16.074 --> 20:20.174
Just a little... I want just a little more time.

20:20.314 --> 20:23.144
I've watched Tatsuya and the Princess
this whole time.

20:23.284 --> 20:26.084
The two of them will definitely be able
to make something...

20:26.754 --> 20:31.924
A world where you won't have to do this.
Not anymore.

20:34.094 --> 20:36.224
My mission shall not change!

20:37.694 --> 20:39.534
No!

20:50.244 --> 20:52.974
I shall grant you a reprieve.

20:55.954 --> 20:56.784
Tatsuya!

20:58.554 --> 21:00.924
Tatsuya! Are you all right, Tatsuya?

21:03.494 --> 21:04.824
I'm so glad...

21:05.064 --> 21:07.824
Karen Clavius has been
apprehended on the Moon.

21:08.994 --> 21:10.194
Karen?

21:10.194 --> 21:12.864
No! Because of Tatsuya and myself?

21:15.274 --> 21:18.364
The Moon and the Earth stand at a crossroads.

21:18.504 --> 21:20.204
Peace or War.

21:20.674 --> 21:22.174
It can't be!

21:22.174 --> 21:27.444
My mission is to not allow the tragedy of war
to be repeated. Do not forget that.

21:37.594 --> 21:38.894
I'm sorry.

21:43.794 --> 21:45.464
Never again...

21:45.464 --> 21:48.864
I'll never let this happen to you again.

21:50.574 --> 21:53.094
I have to go.

22:09.094 --> 22:13.824
That platinum-colored crescent moon

22:13.824 --> 22:21.804
Stands still now, gently

22:21.804 --> 22:29.074
I look up at the sky and think

22:29.074 --> 22:39.554
That falling star is surely the Moon's tears

22:39.554 --> 22:46.994
And I thought of you

22:46.994 --> 22:55.104
Why do I cry these tears?

22:55.104 --> 23:03.014
Though all I am doing is praying for eternity...

23:03.014 --> 23:11.014
I want to walk with you, believing in the future

23:11.014 --> 23:23.264
No matter how many times
the Moon waxes and wanes

23:25.164 --> 23:26.234
Preview

23:26.234 --> 23:28.674
Preview
Their hearts, though bound, are separated
by a distance of 380,000 kilometers.

23:28.674 --> 23:32.204
Their hearts, though bound, are separated
by a distance of 380,000 kilometers.

23:32.204 --> 23:36.674
But if one is prepared to hold fast to one's ideals,
then no matter how great the distance...

23:36.674 --> 23:36.874
- Episode 10-
A Princess With Just One Wing
But if one is prepared to hold fast to one's ideals,
then no matter how great the distance...

23:36.874 --> 23:37.174
- Episode 10-
A Princess With Just One Wing

23:37.174 --> 23:38.984
- Episode 10-
A Princess With Just One Wing
Now then, rise to action!

23:38.984 --> 23:40.144
- Episode 10-
A Princess With Just One Wing
